{"text": "The boys followed the trail and found places where the moose had turned and fought hard against the wolves. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last they crept through the snow and quietly pushed aside the branches of a spruce tree to watch. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The old moose was tired and wounded, yet it kept tossing its great horns at the gray wolves until the very end. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Koskoosh came back from his memories and found the fire almost out, so he put more sticks on it from the small pile. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then a long howl sounded close by, and a cold nose touched his cheek. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He waved a burning stick, and the wolves drew back, but they did not go far, and he heard them moving in a circle around him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In his mind he saw the old moose again, standing alone in the snow while the gray wolves came closer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Why should he hold on to life, Koskoosh asked himself, when it was the law that every life must end. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He let the burning stick fall into the snow, where its little flame quietly went out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then, as the circle of wolves closed in, he bowed his head and thought, Is it not the law of life.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "y", "s", " ", "f", "o", "l", "l", "o", "w", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "r", "a", "i", "l", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "o", "u", "n", "d", " ", "p", "l", "a", "c", "e", "s", " ", "w", "h", "e", "r", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "o", "o", "s", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "t", "u", "r", "n", "e", "d", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "f", "o", "u", "g", "h", "t", " ", "h", "a", "r", "d", " ", "a", "g", "a", "i", "n", "s", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "o", "l", "v", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", "t", " ", "l", "a", "s", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "c",